# --- working documents: never publish (managed) ---
#
# This is a PUBLIC GitHub Pages site. Anything committed here is served at
# ecogetaway.github.io/<filename>. Strategy documents, funding research, intern
# plans and task lists sit in this folder as working files and must never be
# published.
#
# This is an ALLOWLIST, not a deny-list: everything is ignored by default and
# published files are named explicitly below. Extension rules are not enough
# here — the sensitive working files are .md, the same extension as the site's
# own published pages, so *.docx-style rules would miss all of them.
#
# To publish a new file: add a matching ! line below, or git add -f <path>.

/*
!/.gitignore
!/.nojekyll
!/README.md
!/index.html
!/style.css
!/accessibility.html
!/OSS-A11y-Simple-Explainer.md
!/.github/
!/writing/
